<li id="mwdw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_honorifics" title="French honorifics" id="mweA">French honorifics</a></li>
<li id="mweQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_honorifics" title="German honorifics" id="mweg">German honorifics</a></li>
<li id="mwew"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honorifics_in_Judaism" title="Honorifics in Judaism" id="mwfA">Honorifics in Judaism</a></li>
<li id="mwfQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_honorifics" title="Indian honorifics" id="mwfg">Indian honorifics</a></li>
<li id="mwfw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Islamic_honorifics" title="Islamic honorifics" id="mwgA">Islamic honorifics</a></li>
<li id="mwgQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_honorifics" title="Japanese honorifics" id="mwgg">Japanese honorifics</a></li>
<li id="mwgw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Korean_honorifics" title="Korean honorifics" id="mwhA">Korean honorifics</a></li>
